BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Movies at REGAL (SMX) - $1 Family Movies
DTSTART:20260813T150000Z
DTEND:20260813T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260814T101541Z
UID:b56e33f381a6bc3e92429c9e61943aa20eef1f6b@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film,Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Event by Arnot Mall\n3300 Chambers Rd South\, Suite 5127\, Hor
 seheads\, NY\nDuration: 2 hr\nPublic\nFrom June 1 through August 13*\, the
  popular\, family-friendly Summer Movie Express returns to Regal theatres 
 nationwide. For eleven weeks this summer\, participating locations will fe
 ature two PG-rated movies at 11:00 AM every Monday through Thursday for ju
 st $1.00 per ticket for select family films —making it an easy\, afforda
 ble way for families\, camps\, and community groups to enjoy time together
 .\n**Please note that some locations will be extending their programs 1-2 
 extra weeks to accommodate local school schedules. Keep an eye out for add
 itional communications regarding these extensions**\nIn addition\, all att
 endees will receive $3.00 off a Snack Pack (junior-sized drink\, popcorn\,
  and fruit gummies) and/or a cup of refreshingly cold Dippin’ Dots ice c
 ream.\nHere is a quick look at the weekly schedule:\nWeek 1 (June 1–4): 
 Sing (2016) & Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles: Mutant Mayhem (2023)\nWeek 2 (
 June 8–11): Kung Fu Panda 4 (2024) & David (2025)\nWeek 3 (June 15–18)
 : KPop Demon Hunters Sing-Along (2025) & The Wild Robot (2024)\nWeek 4 (Ju
 ne 22–25): The Bad Guys 2 (2025) & The Garfield Movie (2024)\nWeek 5 (Ju
 ne 29–July 2): A Minecraft Movie (2025) & Sonic the Hedgehog 2 (2022)\nW
 eek 6 (July 6–9): How to Train Your Dragon (2025) & Sonic the Hedgehog 3
  (2024)\nWeek 7 (July 13–16): Title TBA & Scoob! (2020)\nWeek 8 (July 20
 –23): The SpongeBob Movie: Search for SquarePants (2025) & Animal Farm (
 2026)\nWeek 9 (July 27–30): Paddington in Peru (2025) & Dog Man (2025)\n
 Week 10 (August 3–6): Charlie the Wonderdog (2026) & Despicable Me 4 (20
 24)\nWeek 11 (August 10–13): The Sandlot (1993) & Muppets: Treasure Isla
 nd (1996)\nFor theatre guests visiting the concession stand as part of the
 ir moviegoing tradition\, Regal is offering two discounted snack items wit
 h the purchase of a ticket to an SMX showtime. All attendees of a Summer M
 ovie Express title will receive $3.00 off a Snack Pack\, which includes a 
 junior-sized drink\, popcorn\, and fruit gummies\, and / or a cup of refre
 shingly cold Dippin’ Dots ice cream.\nAdvance tickets for Summer Movie E
 xpress showtimes are now available for a very family-friendly price of $1.
 00 at theatre box offices / kiosks\, on the mobile app\, and through https
 ://www.regmovies.com Members of Regal Unlimited can also secure tickets fo
 r SMX titles as part of their monthly subscription.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar
  - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78419940/20260723110000
GEO:42.160134;-76.873177
LOCATION:Arnot Mall\, 3300 Chambers Road\, Horseheads\, New York\, 14845\,
  United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78419940/20260723110000
END:VEVENT
