SUMMARY:Montour Falls Farmers Market
DTSTART:20260813T200000Z
DTEND:20260813T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260814T101541Z
UID:8bd21bb665a92e222609e74920700a6b3582ec07@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Farmers Market,Food,Crafts,Family Fun,New to the Area
DESCRIPTION:Vendor attendance will vary and is subject to change. Please c
 heck Facebook & Instagram for the latest updates including cancellations d
 ue to inclement weather and new vendor announcements. Contact vendors dire
 ctly for product availability.\nThe Montour Falls Farmers Market\, in coor
 dination with the Village of Montour Falls and the Montour Falls Fire Depa
 rtment\, supports a close-knit community by providing a place for farmers\
 , small businesses\, artisans\, and organizations to offer their products\
 , talents\, and resources. Our goal is to provide a space to shop local\, 
 socialize\, and explore our community with a sustainable approach.\nMFFM b
 egan in 2016 with the mission of providing fresh\, locally sourced food to
  Montour Falls residents and creating a place for farmers to sell their pr
 oducts in Schuyler County. Upon reaching that goal\, we increased our miss
 ion to include a space for socializing\, entertainment\, and education in 
 an accessible\, welcoming outdoor location. The Montour Falls Farmers Mark
 et supports local farms and small businesses\, and encourages the use of S
 NAP/EBT.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/
 78366788/20260611160000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78366788/20260611160000
END:VEVENT
