 artists at the 34th Annual Ithaca Artist Market\, a juried show and sale f
 eaturing outstanding fine and functional art from across the region.\nEnjo
 y live music by the East Hill Jazz Group while exploring the market\, and 
 treat yourself to delicious food\, wine\, beer\, cider\, and desserts from
  local vendors.\nREGISTRATION with over 50 CHANCES TO WIN ARTIST ITEMS!\nR
 egister in advance and you'll be entered into an amazing raffle with 40+ c
 hances to win artwork from participating artists or tickets from local art
 s organizations. (We also like folks to register so if there is a weather 
 emergency\, we can email you! Generally\, the market is rain or shine.)\nT
 he Ithaca Artist Market is a program of the Community Arts Partnership of 
 Tompkins County.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzp
