 our calendar.\nVisit the website to learn more about the artists and festi
 val details and buy your tickets:\nhttps://www.ElmiraJazzFestival.com\nIt
 ’s More Than Music!\nAll proceeds and donations from the festival benefi
 t The Economic Opportunity Program\, Inc. of Chemung and Schuyler Counties
 \, helping EOP better serve individuals\, children\, and families througho
 ut the community.\nEOP serves more than 5\,000 people annually in the Sout
 hern Tier of New York through programs such as Head Start and Early Head S
