DESCRIPTION:Nasser Civic Center Plaza\nCorning\, NY\nPublic\nCrystal City 
 SummerFeast 2026\nThe Rotary Club of Corning invites the community to Crys
 tal City SummerFeast 2026\, a one-day\, adults-only fundraiser featuring f
 ood\, beverages\, live music\, games\, and summer fun at the Nasser Civic 
 Center.\nBuilding on the success of last year’s inaugural Crystal City O
 ktoberfeAst\, this year’s event brings a warm-weather twist to Rotary’
 s festival fundraiser with a festive Pig\, Swig\, and Boogie theme.\nGuest
 s can enjoy live music\, games\, beverages\, leis\, summer decorations\, a
 nd a relaxed island-inspired festival atmosphere.\nThe food centerpiece fo
 r SummerFeast will be a pig roast and barbecue feast from JR’s Back Alle
 y BBQ\, featuring Hawaiian-inspired flavors and preparations. JR’s will 
 also offer additional barbecue items that are not pork-based. Additional v
 endors will round out the food experience with charcuterie\, desserts\, ic
 e cream\, cookies\, the YMCA’s famous popcorn\, and other seasonal treat
 s.\nEvent details:\nSaturday\, August 15\, 2026\n1:00 PM – 6:00 PM\nNass
 er Civic Center\, Corning\, NY\nAdults only\, 21+ [State or Federal Photo 
 ID]\nLive music throughout the day by Leah Brown and the Side Hustle\, and
  Pocket Trio.\nGames and entertainment by Bobby K\nBeer on tap\, wine by t
 he glass\, lemonade\, and soft drinks.\nEarly-bird tickets are $20 through
  July 31 — a $5 savings off the regular $25 admission price. Beginning A
 ugust 1\, tickets will be $25 online and at the door.\nEvery ticket suppor
 ts Rotary projects that benefit youth\, literacy\, hunger prevention\, env
 ironmental care\, community safety\, and other local and international ser
 vice efforts.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/e
