DESCRIPTION:Join the Silver Thread Winegarden crew for Italian Night at 6:
 30 on Sunday\, August 16th!\nIf you’ve spent time in Corning\, there’s
  a good chance you’ve enjoyed dining under the enthusiastic direction of
  Chef Michael Lanahan. Chef Michael has co-owned The Cellar with his wife\
 , Ellen (General Manager) since 2015. Recently they opened a second restau
 rant just down Market Street: Ellen & Michael’s Osteria & Market\, a cas
 ual Italian spot featuring recipes handed down through the Italian side of
  Michael’s family!\nChef Michael will be here at the Winegarden to cook 
 a delicious Italian meal featuring his classic recipes with a modern twist
 . The menu is still TBD but just like our other summer dinner\, tickets wi
 ll be $70 per person with the option to add on a $20 wine pairing.\nReserv
 ations are required.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b
 0uzpj/event/78429459/20260816183000
