BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Good Grief Day 2026 - Steuben
DTSTART:20260817T140000Z
DTEND:20260817T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260814T101541Z
UID:3d172bcc197677e6675430f1e6b15c880f914e6b@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Literature,Crafts,Connection
DESCRIPTION:Event by CareFirstNY and Southeast Steuben County Library\nSou
 theast Steuben County Library\nDuration: 5 hr\nPublic\nJoin CareFirstNY in
  partnership with the Southeast Steuben County Library for a day of FREE a
 ctivities designed to support children\, teens\, and families who are copi
 ng with grief and loss.\nThrough stories\, crafts\, games\, and connection
 \, participants will have the opportunity to explore healing in a welcomin
 g and supportive environment. No registration required - simply drop in fo
 r the activities that interest you!\n- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
 \nActivities include:\nStorytime with Mr. Ric\n10 AM-10:30 AM\nWe'll read 
 “My Forever Guardian” by Kristina Bingham Jones\, a comforting childre
 n’s book that helps young readers process the loss of a loved one.\nCraf
 t Time with Miss Sue\n10:30 AM-11:30 AM\nFamilies can stay after the story
  for craft time where children will create a special keepsake inspired by 
 the book. All supplies and instruction will be provided.\nFamily Carnival\
 n1:30 PM-3 PM\nIn the afternoon\, families of all ages are invited to enjo
 y a fun-filled Family Carnival featuring games\, prizes\, face painting\, 
 a fishing pond\, balloon pop\, bean bag toss\, and more.\n- - - - - - - - 
 - - - - - - - - - - -\nAll activities are free and open to the community. 
 For more information\, please contact us at GriefSupport@carefirstny.org o
 r (607) 962-3100.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uz
 pj/event/78419962/20260817100000
GEO:42.142288;-77.047119
LOCATION:Southeast Steuben County Library\, 300 Nasser Civic Center Plaza\
 , Corning\, New York\, Corning\, New York\, 14830\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78419962/20260817100000
END:VEVENT
