 st food trucks and local restaurants in the area\, enjoy live music\, and 
 soak up everything that makes downtown Elmira special.\nLive Music Sponsor
 ed by Southern Tier Custom Fabricators\nGood vibes and great tunes are on 
 the playlist every week. Pull up a seat and enjoy live performances throug
 hout the market.\nStory Time at the Market Presented by Farm Credit East a
 nd Gannon Associates Insurance\nNew This Year: More to Come! We're adding 
