 uba. The story with music they'll be sharing with you is "Barb the Band Ba
 t" with music and text by Dr. Daniel N. Thrower. It tells the true story o
 f a librarian who is surprised to encounter an actual bat perched on the m
 usic folders in the historic building that houses the library. This\, alon
