CATEGORIES:Wine,Community
DESCRIPTION:Event by Seneca Lake Wine Trail\nPublic\nOver seven days – A
 ugust 21-28\, 2026 – passholders can enjoy visiting and sampling wines a
 t participating wineries\, during each winery’s regular business hours.\
 nYour pass includes wine tasting\, dog biscuits\, and a special souvenir b
 andana for your dog!\nYou can come for a day or two\, or spread your visit
 s out over the entire event duration (your pass entitles you to one tastin
 g at each winery).\n$50 per tasting pass including taxes and fees. Passes 
 are non-refundable. Ticket insurance is available\, for an extra fee at ch
 eckout via our third party partner.\nOne pass = one complimentary tasting 
 flight poured at each winery.\nYou must be traveling with a dog to purchas
