DESCRIPTION:Let's meet at the Village Square Gazebo at 2:00. We will fan o
 ut to sketch the Village of Hammondsport from there. Meet back at 3:50 for
  a sketch"throwdown" to view each other's work. Come early and view Palett
 es of Keuka paintings created by regional artists (some of our sketchers h
 ave palettes in this exhibit!). Stay after sketching for ice cream or a la
 te afternoon swim! Bring your sketching supplies and a folding chair or st
 ool. Stop into the Chamber of Commerce to get information about the Palett
 es of Keuka Exhibit and more. Let them know that you are with Urban Sketch
 ers! Street parking is available.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calenda
 r.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78434983/20260823140000
