UID:d912aa30aae6ec850ff400ff0671ca3855a86bf8@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music,Beer,Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Event by Steuben Brewing Company\n10286 Judson Rd\, Pulteney\,
  NY\nDuration: 3 hr\nPublic\nElephant Back was formed in 2020 during the C
 OVID pandemic. Two musicians getting together to write some kick ass music
  together. Dave and Sarah proceeded to write\, record\, and mix an entire 
 album in their home studios. Sent it out for mastering and then began crea
 ting stunning visuals in the form of music videos for each song they produ
 ced. Each video was released with each single over the course of a year un
 til the release of the entire album in August 2022. They have been busy to
 uring and recording the next album at many of the most iconic recording st
 udios across the state and across the pond!\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https
