DESCRIPTION:Event by Muse of Fire Theatre\nCorning Community College\nSchu
 yler Theatre Rm. 106\n1 Academic Dr\nCorning\, NY\nDuration: 2 hr\nPublic\
 nDirector Michael Hurd:\n"I am really looking forward to directing LOVE'S 
 LABOUR'S LOST at SUNY CCC this fall. This will be the sixth Shakespearean 
 comedy that I have adapted and directed for the stage\, and though I fall 
 in love with every one of them\, I appreciate the process more with each p
 lay.\nThe best way to understand Shakespeare is to put him on his feet. Th
 at's where his characters become living\, breathing people. They reveal a 
 kind of magic that the text alone cannot.\nIf you think it might be fun to
  be one of them\, then you should audition with us."\nSign-up online at: h
