SUMMARY:Brit Car Sunday Social at The Beerocracy British Pub
DTSTART:20260906T170000Z
DTEND:20260906T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260814T101541Z
UID:30c1b15c315b7d4cb277b7246965e43a32936b54@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Cars,Beer
DESCRIPTION:Own a car like a Mini\, MG\, Jag\, Lotus\, Aston Martin\, Land
  Rover or other British car or Bike model? You definitely don't want to mi
 ss this!!!!\nStarting Sunday\, May 3rd then the first Sunday of every mont
 h through the end of October join us at the Beerocracy British Pub for a s
 ocial afternoon of awesome British Vehicles!\nShowcase your baby or admire
  other classic British cars that people bring!\nWe will be opening up our 
 grass area at the rear of our Snug & Pavilion building (weather permitting
 ) for the cars to pull up onto & creating a showcase area for these amazin
 g machines.\nWalk around and chat to the owners and admire their vehicles 
 or just chill under the pavilion or on the patio and enjoy the lake views.
 ..\nThere is no fee to attend and we don't care about the age of your Brit
 ish Vehicle whether it's an old classic or a newer model we want to see th
 em all and create the biggest British Car meetup in the Finger Lakes.!!\nT
 he main pub or Snug Bar will be open serving a selection of beers\, wines\
 , cocktails and mixed drinks with non-alcoholic options also available.\nF
 ood will also be available for purchase.\nDon't own a British Car Model - 
 No problem! You can still participate and enjoy meeting and seeing all the
  owners/vehicles.\nMember of or know a British Car Club? Let them know abo
 ut this event and encourage them to participate.\nWhat could be better tha
 n amazing British Cars at the Regions Only Proper British Pub!\nEvent by S
 eneca Lake Brewing Co. & The Beerocracy\n4520 STATE ROUTE 14\, Rock Stream
 \n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78398810
 /20260705130000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78398810/20260705130000
END:VEVENT
