 n ever. Join us every Wednesday in Wisner Park from 10:00 AM to 2:00 PM fo
 r a mid-week tradition that brings the community together all summer long.
 \nBrowse more than 30 vendors offering fresh produce\, cut flowers\, handm
 ade crafts\, unique local goods\, and more. Grab lunch from some of the be
 st food trucks and local restaurants in the area\, enjoy live music\, and 
 soak up everything that makes downtown Elmira special.\nLive Music Sponsor
 ed by Southern Tier Custom Fabricators\nGood vibes and great tunes are on 
 the playlist every week. Pull up a seat and enjoy live performances throug
 hout the market.\nStory Time at the Market Presented by Farm Credit East a
 nd Gannon Associates Insurance\nNew This Year: More to Come! We're adding 
 exciting new programming to the 2026 season. Stay tuned for announcements 
 you won't want to miss what's in store. ~ Sponsored by SerVU Credit Union\
 nVisit elmiradowntown.com for updates\, vendor info\, and more.\n\nSource:
