CATEGORIES:Causes,Community,Music
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a meaningful evening at Watkins Glen International
  as we come together to honor the lives lost on September 11 while support
 ing a great cause.\nThe night will feature:\n-Glow Car Show\n-9/11 Memoria
 l Lights\n-EMS units on display\n-Live music\n-Food & beverages available 
 for purchase\nAdmission:\n$10 – General Admission\n$20 – Glow Car Show
  Participants (General Admission Included)\nKids 12 and under are free wit
 h a paying adult.\nAll proceeds from the event will benefit the R.A.C.E. F
 oundation.\nBring your family and friends for an evening of remembrance\, 
 community\, and automotive passion as we transition From Darkness to Light
 . Thank you to our presenting partners\, Kennedy Valve\, Next Era\, and Sa
 hlen’s.\nTickets and car show registration are available here:\nTheGlen.
 com/events/fromdarknesstolight\nThank you for supporting the R.A.C.E. Foun
 dation.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/7
 8437314/20260911190000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78437314/20260911190000
END:VEVENT
