CATEGORIES:Causes,Community,Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Watch the rubber ducks drop from the sky for your chance to wi
 n $1\,000 at Eldridge Park this September! In conjunction with our Future 
 Firefighters Fun Fest\, Eldridge Park is selling numbered rubber ducks thr
 oughout the summer for $5.00 each.\nOn Sunday\, September 13th at 3pm\, th
 e ducks will be hoisted in the air by a 100-foot ladder fire truck and pos
 itioned over a target on the ground. One thousand ducks will be released a
 nd the Lucky duck that lands closest to the target will win $1\,000 cash c
 ourtesy of Margeson Insurance. Tickets are on sale at the Eldridge Park Gi
 ft Shop all summer long.\nSaturday and Sunday (September 12 & 13) will fea
 ture the Future Firefighter Training Show which includes a smoke house\, s
 imulated fire scenes and their epic water cannon. In addition\, local Fire
  Departments will be on hand with their vehicles and equipment while doing
  actual demonstrations of rescue diving\, water rescue\, Motor Vehicle ext
 ractions\, Hazardous materials\nresponses and more.\nThe Duck Drop will ca
 p off the fun-filled themed weekend and the public is encouraged to watch 
 the Ducks Drop live.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b
 0uzpj/event/78384147/20260913150000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78384147/20260913150000
