DESCRIPTION:35 Lake Front Drive\, Geneva\, NY 14456\nLocated next to the F
 inger Lakes Welcome Center along the shore of Seneca Lake\, the Geneva Far
 mers Market offers locally grown produce\, fresh eggs and meats\, flowers\
 , baked goods\, and handmade products. SNAP\, FreshConnect\, FMNP\, and WI
