DESCRIPTION:Event by The Nocturnal Café\n103 S Geneva St\, Ithaca\, NY\nD
 uration: 3 hr\nPublic\nLet's cultivate shared creativity! Come on down to 
 share your song or story at Ithaca favorite weekly open mic night now in i
 ts 5th year! The Nocturnal Café welcomes you to experience our weekly Ope
 n Mic Nite hosted by a rotating cast of talented artists including Aria Da
 wn\, Satya Celeste\, Laik Uticone and more. Showcase your talents and enjo
