 roduces IFC’s hit show Documentary Now. He has also appeared in HBO’s 
 Our Flag Means Death\, Judd Apatow’s The Bubble\, and Amazon’s series 
 Forever. He voices characters in Big Mouth and The Mitchells vs. The Machi
 nes. He is currently starring in the Broadway play All In. Armisen is an 1
 1-season veteran of Saturday Night Live. From 2014-2024\, Armisen was band
  leader of the 8G Band on Late Night With Seth Meyers.\n\nSource: FLXcalen
